BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316845450@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053222Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T103000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! Garret Mountain
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJoin me for the paved loop at Garret Mountain Re
 servation.\n\nWe will meet at the parking lot on the loop\, turn right on 
 Park Ave from Mountain Ave\, lot is on the left. GPS Address for Garrett i
 s 8 Mountain Ave Woodland Park.\n\nGarret Mountain Reservation\, located i
 n both Woodland Park and Paterson\, is one of Passaic County’s most freq
 uented parks. The original landscape was designed by the famed Olmsted Bro
 thers Firm. The 310 acres of recreational space sits more than 500 feet ab
 ove sea level\, with scenic views of Paterson and the New York City skylin
 e. Lambert Castle and Lambert Tower\, two of Passaic County’s historic s
 ites\, are also located within Garret Mountain Reservation.\n\nRain or ext
 reme weather will cancel the event.\n\nCollaborative walk with "Montclair 
 Women Over 50."\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for a hike\, please understa
 nd that you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-being and w
 ill hold no one else liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316845450/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261004T222619Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T222619Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316722805@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053222Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316722805/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260926T132850Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260926T132850Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
